                              "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                              "args": {
                                "text": [
                                  "Mara asks whether\nthe newer sale\nproposal means she\nmust call a\nprivate estate",
                                  "office. Consider\nthe dates,\nsignatures, and\nthe rule about\nentering a deed.",
                                  "Which conclusion\ncan the clerk\nsupport? Pip will\nput it on her\nreferral card and",
                                  "sign his name, so\na confident guess\ncould send her\nback into the\ncold."
                                ],
